  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1.\tThe proposed double sided advert panel measuring 6m in height and 1.5m in width, by virtue of size, position, design and appearance would have an unacceptable impact on the visual amenity of the area, and would not be compatible with the amenity and character of the surrounding area. The proposal does not preserve the character of the Grove Park Conservation Area and will be a visual intrusion within the land identified as Metropolitan Open Land. The structure is therefore contrary to PPG 19 and policies ENV-B 1.1, ENV-B 1.2, ENV-B 1.4, ENV-B 2.2, ENV-N 1.5, N.1.6, N.1.7, B.1.8, N.2.10 and W.1.1 of the Council's Unitary Development Plan and London Plan policies."
